---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const updated = '29 September 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice"
  description="How ZanamTech collects, uses and protects information submitted through this website."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Notice"
    lead={`How we handle information submitted through this website. Last updated ${updated}.`}
    breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Notice' }]}
  />

  <article class="container-page max-w-3xl space-y-10 py-16 text-muted lg:py-20 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:font-bold [&_h2]:text-fg [&_p]:mt-3 [&_ul]:mt-3 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:space-y-1.5 [&_ul]:pl-5">
    <section>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit a consultation request, we collect the information you provide:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Full name, work email address and company</li>
        <li>Role and service of interest (optional)</li>
        <li>The content of your message and your consent confirmation</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not ask for, and ask you not to submit, sensitive personal data or confidential system credentials.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        Your information is used solely to respond to your request, schedule consultations and prepare any resulting
        proposal. We do not sell your information or add it to marketing lists.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Form processing</h2>
      <p>
        Form submissions are transmitted over an encrypted connection to a third-party form processing provider, which
        delivers them to our team by email. The provider acts on our instructions and applies automated spam
        filtering.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use cookies for tracking or advertising. We may use privacy-first, cookieless analytics
        that record aggregated, anonymous usage statistics (such as page views and referrers) without identifying
        individual visitors. Your theme preference is stored locally in your browser and never leaves your device.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain enquiry information only for as long as necessary to respond to you and to manage any resulting
        engagement, after which it is deleted.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of the information you have submitted at any time by
        contacting us.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, email
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="font-semibold text-link underline underline-offset-2">{site.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
